WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.240
Tuna pande tatu sawa,

00:03.240 --> 00:05.502
au vitu vitatu vinavyofanana.

00:05.502 --> 00:06.960
Vyote vinauzani sawa, lakini

00:06.960 --> 00:09.290
hatujui uzani wa kila kimojawapo.

00:09.290 --> 00:12.260
Tunachokijua kama unajumlisha uzani,

00:12.260 --> 00:15.194
ni sawa na uzani wa hivi vitu tisa

00:15.194 --> 00:15.860
hapa.

00:15.860 --> 00:18.440
Na hivi vitu tisa vinauzani wa kilogramu 1.

00:18.440 --> 00:20.647
Kiujumla, tunakiligramu 9 upande huu.

00:20.647 --> 00:22.230
Na hapa, tuna vitu vitatu.

00:22.230 --> 00:23.490
Vina uzani sawa.

00:23.490 --> 00:24.698
Na hatuvijui ni nini.

00:24.698 --> 00:26.206
Tunaviita uzani x.

00:26.206 --> 00:27.580
Nachotaka kufanya hapa ni

00:27.580 --> 00:29.740
kujaribu kufanya kiishara.

00:29.740 --> 00:32.090
Kwenye video ya mwisho, tumesema, kwanini

00:32.090 --> 00:36.494
tusizidishe 1/3 ya hii na kuzidisha 1/3 ya hii?

00:36.494 --> 00:37.910
Na pia, kimsingi, tunaenda

00:37.910 --> 00:39.600
kuweka vitu sawa, kwa sababu

00:39.600 --> 00:42.030
tunachukua 1/3 ya uzani sawa.

00:42.030 --> 00:44.120
Jumla hii ni sawa na jumla hii.

00:44.120 --> 00:45.740
Ndio maana kipimo kina uwiano.

00:45.740 --> 00:48.640
Tufikiri kuhusu tunavyoweza kuiwakilisha hii

00:48.640 --> 00:49.357
kiishara.

00:49.357 --> 00:51.190
Kitu cha kwanza ninachofikiri kuhusu hii

00:51.190 --> 00:56.830
ni, tunaweza kuweka mlinganyo

00:56.830 --> 01:01.490
unaowakilisha kwamba tuna vitu vitatu vya uzani x,

01:01.490 --> 01:05.071
na kiujumla, uzani wake ni sawa na uzani wote

01:05.071 --> 01:05.570
hapa?

01:05.570 --> 01:07.500
Tunaweza kuwakilisha kama mlinganyo?

01:07.500 --> 01:10.946
Na nitakupa dakika chache kufanya hii.

01:10.946 --> 01:12.070
Safi, tufikiri kuhusu hii.

01:12.070 --> 01:14.280
Hapa, tuna vitu vitatu vyenye uzani x.

01:14.280 --> 01:16.330
Hivyo uzani wa jumla, tunaandika

01:16.330 --> 01:22.010
tuandike ujumla wao kama x jumlisha x jumlisha x.

01:22.010 --> 01:25.940
Na hapa, tuna vitu tisa vyenye uzani wa kilogramu 1.

01:25.940 --> 01:29.970
Tunaandika 1 jumlisha 1 jumlisha 1.

01:29.970 --> 01:30.530
Hii ni 3.

01:30.530 --> 01:33.292
Jumlisha 1 jumlisha 1 jumlisha 1 jumlisha 1.

01:33.292 --> 01:34.000
Ziko ngapi izo?

01:34.000 --> 01:39.330
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9.

01:39.330 --> 01:41.542
Na, hiki ni kiwakilisho cha mahesabu.

01:41.542 --> 01:43.295
Kama tunatengeneza mlinganyo,

01:43.295 --> 01:44.490
ni kiwakilisho cha aljebra.

01:44.490 --> 01:46.490
Sio njia rahisi ya kufanya hii,

01:46.490 --> 01:48.130
lakini ni njia nzuri ya kufanya hii.

01:48.130 --> 01:51.290
Tunaweza sema, kama nina x jumlisha na x nyingine

01:51.290 --> 01:53.460
na x nyingine, nina x tatu,

01:53.460 --> 01:57.280
Naandika hii kama 3x.

01:57.280 --> 01:59.090
Na 3x itakuwa sawa?

01:59.090 --> 02:02.180
Kama tunajumlisha hizi 1 zote hapa 1

02:02.180 --> 02:02.892
jumlisha 1 jumlisha 1.

02:02.892 --> 02:03.600
Tunafanya hivyo.

02:03.600 --> 02:05.807
Tuna 9 ya hizi, hivyo tunapata 3x ni sawa na 9.

02:05.807 --> 02:07.140
Ngoja nihakikishe nafanya ivi.

02:07.140 --> 02:11.616
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9.

02:11.616 --> 02:12.990
Na hivi ndivyo tunavyotengeneza.

02:12.990 --> 02:15.480
Swali lifuatalo ni, tunafanya nini?

02:15.480 --> 02:17.429
Tunafanyaje kimahesabu?

02:17.429 --> 02:19.220
Kwa moja ya hii milinganyo,

02:19.220 --> 02:21.050
lakini tutajikita kwa hii moja.

02:21.050 --> 02:23.630
Tunafanyaje kimahesabu ili

02:23.630 --> 02:25.930
kimsingi kupata x?

02:25.930 --> 02:29.430
Ili kufikiri uzani huu ulivyo?

02:29.430 --> 02:33.160
Na nitakupa dakika mbili kufikiri kuhusi ili.

02:33.160 --> 02:34.620
Tulivyofanya mara ya mwisho

02:34.620 --> 02:36.244
kwa kipimo hiki tumesema, tuna

02:36.244 --> 02:38.490
pata tatu ya hizi x hapa.

02:38.490 --> 02:40.320
Tunataka kuwa na x hapa.

02:40.320 --> 02:42.090
Tunasema, kivyovyote hii x ilivyo,

02:42.090 --> 02:43.787
kama kipimo kinabaki sawa,

02:43.787 --> 02:45.745
kitakuwa sawa kama chochote kilicho hapa.

02:45.745 --> 02:49.075
Unaweza kushawishika kutoa mbili ya hizi x

02:49.075 --> 02:50.950
labda kwa upande huu, lakini haitatusaidia.

02:50.950 --> 02:53.190
Na tunaona mahesabu hapa.

02:53.190 --> 02:55.630
Kama tutatoa x mbili kutoka pande mbili,

02:55.630 --> 02:58.174
upande wa kushoto tunaenda kuwa na 3x toa 2x.

02:58.174 --> 02:59.590
Na upande wa kulia,

02:59.590 --> 03:01.610
tunaenda kuwa na 9 toa 2x.

03:01.610 --> 03:03.860
Na utabakiwa na 3 ya kitu

03:03.860 --> 03:05.790
toa 2 ya kitu ni 1 ya kitu.

03:05.790 --> 03:08.856
Tutakuwa na x hapa kama tutaondoa hizi mbili.

03:08.856 --> 03:11.230
Lakini upande wa kulia, tunaenda kupata 9 toa 2

03:11.230 --> 03:11.370
x.

03:11.370 --> 03:13.100
Hivyo x bado haijakusaidia.

03:13.100 --> 03:16.020
Bado tunauzani mkubwa upande wa kulia.

03:16.020 --> 03:17.430
Hivyo hii haijasaidia.

03:17.430 --> 03:20.065
Na tumefanya hiki mara ya mwisho.

03:20.065 --> 03:22.190
Tumesema, vipi kama tukichukua 1/3 ya hivi vitu?

03:22.190 --> 03:25.180
Kama tutachukua1/3 ya vitu hivi na kuchukua 1/3 ya vitu hivi,

03:25.180 --> 03:27.680
bado tutapata uzani sawa pande zote

03:27.680 --> 03:29.860
kwa sababu kitu asili kina uzani sawa.

03:29.860 --> 03:31.818
Na mlingano wa kufanya hii kimahesabu

03:31.818 --> 03:35.260
ni kusema, kwanini tusizidishe pande zote kwa 1/3?

03:35.260 --> 03:37.860
Njia nyingine ni kugawanya pande zote kwa 1/3.

03:37.860 --> 03:41.670
Kuzidisha kwa 1/3 ni sawa na kugawanya pande zote kwa 3.

03:41.670 --> 03:44.340
Hivyo tunazidisha pande zote kwa 1/3.

03:44.340 --> 03:47.330
Tunapozidisha pande zote kwa 1/3 ya hapa,

03:47.330 --> 03:49.520
kama una x tatu, unazidisha kwa 1/3,

03:49.520 --> 03:51.340
unabakiwa na x moja.

03:51.340 --> 03:53.910
Kama una tisa ya haya maboksi yenye kilogramu moja,

03:53.910 --> 03:59.130
unaizidisha kwa 1/3, unaenda kubakiwa na tatu.

03:59.130 --> 04:00.830
Na hapa, unaweza kuona

04:00.830 --> 04:03.690
kama unagawanya kwa 3, ni sawa na kuzidisha

04:03.690 --> 04:07.200
kwa 1/3, unagawanya kwa 3.

04:07.200 --> 04:09.560
Kama unagawanya kwa 3.

04:09.560 --> 04:13.670
Una x sawa na 1 jumlisha 1 jumlisha 1.

04:13.670 --> 04:15.360
X ni sawa na 3.

04:15.360 --> 04:18.380
Au unaona hapa x ni sawa na 3.

04:18.380 --> 04:19.680
Hapa unafanya mahesabu.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.333
1/3 mara 3 ni 1

04:21.333 --> 04:23.320
Unabakiwa na 1x 1.

04:23.320 --> 04:27.420
Umebakiwa na x ni sawa na 9 mara 1/3.

04:27.420 --> 04:29.900
Unaweza kuiona kama 9 gawanya kwa 3,

04:29.900 --> 04:37.380
ambayo ni sawa na 3.
